  "text_conditions": {
    "reference": "Keith Thibodeaux, born December 1, 1950, played Little Ricky on I Love Lucy and The Lucy-Desi Comedy Hour. His last name was changed to \"Keith\" by producer Desi Arnaz due to pronunciation difficulties. He is the last living regular cast member from I Love Lucy."
